december, 2018


structure
./data - location of data
	karnataka_cell_rct.dta - karnataka cell phone rct data
	haryana_rct_Table3.csv - haryana data for table 3	haryana_rct_Table2_villagelevel.dta - haryana data for summary stats	haryana_rct_Table2_seedslevel.dta - haryana data for summary stats	haryana_rct_Figure3.csv - haryana data for figure 3
	karnataka_gossip_processed.dta - karnataka networks gossip data
	nomination_data.dta - karnataka networks gossip nominated characteristics data
	nominating_features.dta - karnataka networks gossip nominating features data
	all_hh_data - covariates for karnataka data

./do - location of files for regression analysis
	analysis_cell_RCT.do - analysis file for karnataka cell phone rct
	analysis_haryana_rct_Table3.R - analysis file for haryana immunization rct table
	analysis_haryana_rct_Figure3.R - analysis file for haryana immunization rct figure
	analysis_haryana_rct_Table2 - analysis file for haryana immunization summary table
	analysis_gossip.do - analysis file for karnataka networks gossip

./tables - location of all output

./tables/Figures_Tables_viewer - tex file to compile and view all results
